ACCURACY OF FIGURES
-------------------

Hardware specifications and model artifact sizes in this project are drawn from
vendor documentation and published model repositories, cited in the page's
"Sources and uncertainty" section and in the model registry's provenance
fields. They were accurate as read on the dates recorded and may since have
changed.

Worker counts are memory arithmetic, not benchmarks. They do not account for
backend choice, multimodal input, preserved reasoning state, or runtime
overhead beyond the stated context reserve. Verify against the actual hardware
and runtime before making a purchase.
